From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Feb 2026 16:56:40 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1704/5749] fix(background-cancel): skip notification when user
 explicitly cancels tasks

- Add skipNotification option to cancelTask method
- Apply skipNotification to background_cancel tool
- Prevents unwanted notifications when user cancels via tool
